{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "cceedfdc8566ce640238b9e92c46a2dd8b4780d857f5f256f5d43190ca6f5741", "ja": "とびきりきゅーとなお姫様！なのです", "zh": "是特别可爱的公主喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5408ba74abb4b80334e7f05c32527015b748f5186b847ec093b10346317042c5", "ja": "お姫様をテーマとした新ユニットを任され、\nまつりに声をかけるプロデューサー。続いて\n出会ったエミリーも加わり、二人でお揃い、\n『双子のお姫様』というコンセプトを得て\n新デュオユニットが始動した。", "zh": "制作人受命打造以公主为主题的新团体，\n因此找上茉莉。后来遇上的艾蜜莉也加入，\n于是想到『双胞胎公主』这个概念，\n让两人打扮得一模一样，\n全新的双人组团体就此正式起步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f8798e5f84709e474dc0abfd389c21602f5974b7d1e75ef45352fa9f8395aee", "ja": "（さて、お姫様がイメージのユニットか。\nうちの劇場でお姫様といえば、やっぱり……）", "zh": "（公主风格的团体啊，\n说到我们剧场里的公主……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "4116c2ba077b56e6ad33b45ca181d5fee726b0c8f80b4e957d71e6dc69169691", "ja": "ふんふんふーん、ふふふーん♪\nくるくる、くるくる……。", "zh": "哼哼哼──哼哼哼──♪\n卷卷、卷卷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1002_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a3b6f6e7aac927e1d6a629f70ab576ac2a8680d582e23104bbfd875ffe6fb563", "ja": "まつり、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "茉莉，可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "e144c1134d79f001b5fca59ec00c673b969769f59145bc08daa92a0da39bb090", "ja": "…………ほ？", "zh": "…………哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8a1fe72f571ad19102ebf6e7908683e216dac780bf290e018d37bfc9955713fa", "ja": "やっぱりここにいたんだな、ちょうど良かった。\n実は、今度……。", "zh": "正好，你果然在这里。\n其实这次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "e98337f4c77292bf792055421dcf3d370e15ad04b4727e410f4db87d5a5639e2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、めっ！なのです。\nレディの部屋を尋ねる時は、ノックをするのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，不行的喔！\n拜访淑女的房间时，应该先敲门才对的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "50b8264cdc04a8906ae212ed2d1aba2eacc6960eaf6ec3af0c8f3502d1e2a311", "ja": "姫は今、くるくるの魔法をかけていたのです。途中で\n誰かに見られてしまったら、効果が半減なのです～！", "zh": "公主刚刚在施展卷卷魔法的喔，\n要是中途被人看到了，效果会减半的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6f992bb6d3264b09e95c9d4741fbf4318d12c7644ef6a1d0873b471be6428236", "ja": "いや、ノックしたんだけど……そうか、\n髪を巻いてたんだな。ごめん、気をつけるよ。", "zh": "不，我刚刚有敲门……这样啊，\n原来你在卷头发，抱歉，我下次会注意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "a6b0c4e557d6baee533235587248d9e32551f69dc8844f1d3adb4618bccb0161", "ja": "それで、{$P$}さん。\n姫に何かご用なのです？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，\n你有什么事找公主的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "71d041d28ff71d92f278b6b81bfed1f932260ba934ac78d04bd3ea98068dfdfb", "ja": "ああ、うん。今度、新しいユニットを\n考えてるんだけど……まつり、やってみないか？", "zh": "没错，我们接下来打算组一个新团体……\n茉莉，你要不要试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5098ab3705f33ce8cad22ff74cbb03099344d29b2ec437a8f7978d6306da5dd3", "ja": "コンセプトイメージは、お姫様だ！\nまつりにピッタリだと思わないか？", "zh": "主要概念是公主！\n不觉得正好适合你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "85da355699dd844911466025b4f61c6371ac4d0c5d8040d70c97c8314d3e1776", "ja": "お姫様？　……わんだほー！！", "zh": "公主……？太美妙了──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6457c3de72213ca6983d54aa2130e0ae4366223bb8566b3ee7584204e398d372", "ja": "やっぱり、お姫様といえばまつりだよな。\nよし、それじゃ早速……。", "zh": "说到公主果然就要找茉莉呢。\n好，那我们赶紧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "9544e8828c44ed4413f54ac0706b69df35b94cefaa411180d730ffb2e525162e", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nじゃすと・あ・もーめんと、なのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\nJust a moment，的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8cf0b8ceb4eed714ea22a66c81b6e43cf5eb10ac7a19e7c73d06d5dbe1eeb230", "ja": "え？　ど、どうしたんだ、まつり。\n何か問題があるのか？", "zh": "咦？怎、怎么了，茉莉？\n有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "e8060d02ade69ee2cd6f311e15d84d34289264da523690c4d08d61d9df8e0a3e", "ja": "大アリなのです！　まつりを選んでくれたのは、\nとってもうれしいのですけど……。", "zh": "问题可大了喔！\n虽然茉莉很开心被选中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "ac2a403c71039160b0c314088808c0ba1b4e385a38b488fc452c8ae12582e1e9", "ja": "まつりは姫なので、普段のまつりと変わらないのです。\nファンのみんなは、つまらなくないのです？", "zh": "但茉莉本来就是公主，这和平常的茉莉一模一样的喔，\n粉丝不会觉得很无趣的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ac9c44a158f068eda3b9ffdccfa28c22ed6d779b781edf224e9f9a1e07d1b7b8", "ja": "その事なんだけど。実は今回のユニットは、\nデュオにしてみようかと思っているんだ。", "zh": "关于这个问题，其实这次的团体，\n我打算组成双人组。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "444f74b515e399a2288f0801a8ea19b7c4788271db2b31af6544f47260a680fb", "ja": "こう、お姫様っぽい衣装で……色違いとかの\nお揃いにしたら、面白いんじゃないかって。", "zh": "穿上公主风格的服装……\n做成相同款式、不同颜色，应该会很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "84b622ed8f781760fe0cec805ee4dd66865b89bbffa72b53e9db18b5b2423f1c", "ja": "ふたりで、色違い……お揃い……。", "zh": "两个人穿不同颜色……相同款式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bfecdeb28a52ed406583f4bcda219d8471dda8d9384242c74d3f401e32bfc666", "ja": "あ、ごめん。\nもしかして、そういうのイヤだったか？", "zh": "啊，抱歉，\n莫非你不喜欢和别人一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "f51c67f70d24202c38fb849f29b704c66b346426690f3a4d54f12bc6db27e4f6", "ja": "お揃い、姫は大歓迎なのです～！　きゅーと！な姫が\nふたりいれば、そーきゅーと！なデュオになるのです！", "zh": "公主非常欢迎相同款式的呀～！如果有两个\n非常可爱的公主，一定会成为更可爱的双人组的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "c1a76e5d25f9a96154b066c1cebd900411fb3d7ad40577d8c17c2ccbaa980c08", "ja": "それで、誰と姫がデュオになるのです？\n早く教えてほしいのです！", "zh": "然后是谁要和公主组双人组呢？\n真想赶快知道的呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "bcffdcab5a0448be3f1313c46d1dc38e46655fe701f902f35b2407664dab5352", "ja": "お、おお？\nもうひとりについては、まだ考え中だけど……。", "zh": "喔、喔喔？\n另外一个人选我还在考虑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1025_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "2cc3fb723f431d64424e1de2d7c826c274290bb4b06bde3a827778edf76622fe", "ja": "失礼します……あっ、仕掛け人さま。\nまつりさんも、お疲れさまです♪", "zh": "打扰了……啊，策划执行人先生，\n还有茉莉，两位辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "2428d34af4a2d71c89320abd72537a3e0513ec2d0c8fbe71614b0c1fcf6ab23f", "ja": "もしかして、お仕事のお話中でしたか？\nお邪魔だったら、すみません。", "zh": "两位该不会是在谈工作的事？\n如果打扰到你们，真对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "077521d67f50bcb00bd780f5c337bd31e0e03c4d38177e4ecf70c52b8916663f", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\nエミリーは、レッスンが終わったところか？", "zh": "不，没事的。\n你刚结束训练课程吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "c81bef9e8bd8c35c8561bd2a66055e9809cf90e78234bea96321218b8ed948f9", "ja": "はい、しっかり教えていただきました♪\n大和撫子になるために必要なことを、たくさん。", "zh": "是的，我学到了很多♪\n学到很多成为大和抚子必要的知识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "0bfd9da8872dd7b429a15916c447e01e23b62dd8107106c52262b5af4e25bbe4", "ja": "私はまだまだ未熟者ですが、精進を重ねて……今より\nもっと、ごヒイキ様方に喜んでいただきたいです♪", "zh": "虽然我还不够成熟，但会不断精进……\n希望能让主顾们更加开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "7d64eabb2da166e6b17a5b05057b85947b058d08c8a10607da0123f3a2271980", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nまつり、ピーンと来たのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n茉莉有灵感了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "9d255042f125da798ec089b659d654cc67456e3bc13a7f6adae1aaa432cded70", "ja": "なるほど……エミリーか。\nいいかもしれないな。意外性もあるし……。", "zh": "原来如此……艾蜜莉吗？\n说不定很不错喔，也有惊喜感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "2ec70ba58c9126212cb3f72432ce0c09159ec4ceca6c346828a9b0897964c211", "ja": "あ、あの……？　どうかなさったのですか？\nおふたりとも、何だか目がらんらんと……。", "zh": "那、那个……？请问发生什么事了吗？\n两位的眼神怎么闪闪发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "d3ccd33dea947fdf71c915aa723af2e68935d5a858dc87a14323d1f1e24c5b89", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。姫と一緒に、わんだほー！で\nびゅーてぃほー！な、デュオを組みませんか？", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，要不要和公主组个\n美妙又美丽的双人组呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "c2083f00d444c5bc6f215950d04adc32d0c08ac6cc2203c6dbde089b7d2bd85a", "ja": "えっ？　素晴らしく美しい、二人組……ですか？", "zh": "咦？美妙又美丽的两人团体吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "162414b0e4a79a9228a8e4268f7ba15478bb9fbf1bccea16e7cdb6a55bb45094", "ja": "エミリー、まつりとデュオを組んでみないか？\nコンセプトは、お姫様なんだけど……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，要不要试试和茉莉组双人组？\n这次的主题是公主……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "5ee1d1f1969d2efd6ce685a667e4bc20e9a55d692335a69d823e38c82136c246", "ja": "Wow！？　まつりさんと、お姫様を……？\n本当に、私でよろしいのですか！？", "zh": "Wow！？和茉莉一起饰演公主……？\n我真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "aab461d71ed710a5b41c684a266553025698ae1fa80f40395f0d9699261d189c", "ja": "エミリーちゃんは、とってもキラキラなのです。\nきっと素敵なお姫様になれるのですよ。", "zh": "小艾蜜莉非常闪亮的喔，\n一定能成为迷人的公主的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1039_032emi", "source_sha256": "b9c015938632f4d62d7ff54ae2a73a0c749f7fbe97f46abebae2c3eb1130f9ca", "ja": "素敵なお姫様……！　私、やってみたいです！\n仕掛け人さま、お願いします！", "zh": "迷人的公主……！我想试试看！\n策划执行人先生，拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "aceb6abf8fbfad148909dba254f4f15ff7979460560c3c484b319279a4dcd106", "ja": "よかった！　これでデュオが決まったな。\n早速、衣装を発注しておかないと……。", "zh": "太好了！这么一来双人组的人选就决定了。\n要快点订制服装才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "dc1233ce7afcee7991763f567a946c36eb8fb09b7ddc914b14098520fd1c8792", "ja": "わぁっ、楽しみです♪　お姫様の着物……\n舞台で着るなら、やはり振り袖でしょうか？", "zh": "哇，我好期待♪公主的和服……\n如果要穿上舞台，应该会是振袖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "89370e71ed8889f3978fab4e1672bfd2583d3cd755ffe37aa1b5e237d6078620", "ja": "まつりさんとお揃いの着物が着られるなんて……\nはあ、素晴らしい舞台になりそうです♪", "zh": "竟然能和茉莉穿同款和服……\n哇，感觉会是很美好的表演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "8539c465cd0104fc80296c2a39a42e596e4db0363f2ddffbf0bd7881b5bcb9de", "ja": "振り袖……あっ、そうか！\nエミリー、和風のお姫様を想像してたんだな？", "zh": "振袖……啊，原来如此！\n艾蜜莉，你想像的是日式公主吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "ca0315fc2e25633ed6d35fe37e3ecac3da526e4ab7e35002aa4517cebb70b74a", "ja": "えっ？　ち、違うのですか？", "zh": "咦？不、不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "53db7dc5b8d66047c38030fe1525476a04e58d6b7a9259b400d705cd423fbbfe", "ja": "うん。後でふたりにも聞いてもらうけど、\n曲があるんだよ。それだと、西洋風かなって……。", "zh": "嗯，歌曲已经做好了，\n之后也会放给你们听，应该会是西洋风格的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "279b268c204ead22bfda908db06682625919bc89053ee6ff91e5a1e3149b10ab", "ja": "そんな……。\n私と、まつりさんの二人組なのに……？", "zh": "怎么会……\n明明是我和茉莉的两人团体……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "8e42f7260d5aa8c7333b038c7fa75d351e63de79e1f0e6ec55177644689e6e4d", "ja": "西洋風でも、まつりとエミリーなら\n可愛いと思うんだけどな。姉妹みたいで。", "zh": "就算是西洋风格，我想茉莉和艾蜜莉\n一定也会很可爱呀，就像姊妹一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1048_021mat", "source_sha256": "8ad5ecad4b9d9b98293d574ee9aa8b737175046f2e2a2beba5967f77a48cc669", "ja": "姉妹……。", "zh": "姊妹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "7a58e255c603ccd5f4698e1d84973f6f7ddf8deb67df775c668a42a792999176", "ja": "はいほー！", "zh": "Hi Ho──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1050_032emi", "source_sha256": "55145d4aeb61c636d827b327d9180b5e08b63bf8f46165e3ecba3ed3ae9e8840", "ja": "キャッ！？\n……ま、まつりさん？", "zh": "呀！？\n……茉、茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1051_021mat", "source_sha256": "0efa920fbc9b6000857e0d108e1fec2b47880745aecda072f7c3bfa24bd616bd", "ja": "まつり、ひらめいたのです！\nコンセプトは、『双子のお姫様』がいいのですー！", "zh": "茉莉灵光一闪了喔！\n就用『双胞胎公主』当主题吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1052_021mat", "source_sha256": "9ef7b53cd01a28c412611be6a709dd72948e40c36f5753ec4d76f49d563d6e42", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nお揃いなら、姉妹より双子のほうがいいのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n要穿相同款式的话，比起姊妹，不如设定成双胞胎喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1053_021mat", "source_sha256": "587bc17135499feddedce6a34a6884bebe40f92885ed860841cffd4805f485cd", "ja": "エミリーちゃんとまつり姫なら、ピッタリなのです。\nね？　……ね？", "zh": "正好适合小艾蜜莉和茉莉公主，\n呐？……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "dbcdbf5b038eb72d47647162de7015fc2d8fca321eb488083e1026f3e4d78e45", "ja": "う、うん……そうだな。\nそう言われると、そんな気もしてきた！", "zh": "是、是呀……没错，\n听你这么一说，感觉很有道理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "25a1a24fc197face82a55d8d261d41fc4af061cf275961c8ff628ff257ea9265", "ja": "私とまつりさんが、双子……。いったい、どんな\n二人組になるのでしょう？　想像がつきません……。", "zh": "我和茉莉扮演双胞胎……到底会变成\n什么样的两人团体呢？真是难以想像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1056_021mat", "source_sha256": "6fb70e6c5b0fd94600b1609a7dc4cdb49fb5b43939d58b877f2b0574881db0de", "ja": "それは、姫も同じなのです。\nエミリーちゃん、一緒にがんばりましょー！", "zh": "公主也是一样的喔，\n小艾蜜莉，一起加油吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0070_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0070_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "5aa3e031acdf5f2e5df7cb14b10b91092d6b3fb27b7e0704a7c95e18faefb367", "ja": "（まつりとエミリーで、双子のお姫様か……\n直感で選んだけど、いいデュオになるかもな！）", "zh": "（茉莉和艾蜜莉饰演双胞胎公主啊……\n虽然是用直觉选的，但也许会成为很不错的双人组喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
